# interleaved+deinterleaved offsets are unchanged. Mirrors Vulkan's A2B10G10R10_SNORM_PACK32
# intent (8-bit precision, exact for axis normals). GPU-verified: the native Dawn census
# test vertex_buffer_fetch_mode GPU_COMP_I10 INT_TO_FLOAT_UNIT goes FAIL->PASS (un-defers
# gpu-comp-i10-vertex-format); the web gbuffer -Y face normal flips +Y->-Y; whole-window
